Value Required MODULE (\S+)
Value DIVISION (\d+)
Value NAME (\S+)
Value VENDOR (.*?)
Value PHY_STATUS (\S+)
Value POWER_STATUS (\S+)
Value COM_STATUS (\S+)
Value RUN_STATUS (\S+)
Value INPUT_TYPE (\S+)

Start
  ^${DIVISION}\s+${MODULE}\s+${NAME}\s+${VENDOR}\s+${PHY_STATUS}\s+${POWER_STATUS}\s+${COM_STATUS}\s+${RUN_STATUS}\s+${INPUT_TYPE}\s*$$ -> Record
